This is to announce the availability of accounts on a new SELinux 
community developer server: taiga.selinuxproject.org.

Services provided on the server include:

    * SSH shell access
    * Personal web hosting
    * Email
    * Trac
    * Git hosting
    * Mailing lists
    * Yum/Apt repository hosting 

If you're an SELinux developer, contact me directly for an account. 
Generally, you will be required to be an established community SELinux 
developer.


